## 🚩 Red Flags to Watch For During KT

| Red Flag | Risk | Action |
|----------|------|--------|
| "It's complex, I'll explain later" | Knowledge silo | Push for documentation NOW, escalate to PM |
| No test coverage in critical areas | Blind changes | Add tests before they leave, even basic ones |
| Secrets in code or shared docs | Security breach risk | Escalate to DevOps immediately |
| No rollback procedure | High-risk deploys | Refuse to accept KT as complete until documented |
| Only one person knows how X works | Bus factor = 1 | Make it YOUR priority to learn X first |
| "We don't use Jira, we use chat" | No audit trail | Create your own tracking system |
| No monitoring or alerting | Silent failures | Set up basic monitoring before they leave |
| No CI/CD — manual deploys | Error-prone releases | Document every manual step as a runbook |
| Inconsistent environments | "Works on my machine" | Document all env differences |
| No disaster recovery plan | Catastrophic risk | Escalate to management |

